Title: Beast Finder

Summary: Walks Route 38 with Repel until Raikou or Entei appears, then pauses for a manual catch (English Crystal VC)

Description: |
  Automates the title screen, Continue, crossing the Route 38 gate until a beast is on the route, pacing the grass with Repel, then pauses on the first beast encounter. Resets only when the Repel runs low or no beast comes near, before any encounter.
  Crystal's original RNG determines every encounter. No target Advance or DV combination is selected.
  Stops on any Raikou or Entei encounter or when the user presses B. Creates no SD log.
  Supports Old 3DS/2DS at 268 MHz and New 3DS/2DS at 268 or 804 MHz.

Compatibility: Any
MemorySize: 5MiB
